The app
-------
Moonlight for Android (GPL-3.0): The app MoonCast grew from: PC streaming, the on-screen controller. https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-android  [licences/gpl-3.0.txt]
moonlight-common-c (GPL-3.0): The PC streaming protocol. https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-common-c  [licences/gpl-3.0.txt]
ENet (MIT): Inside moonlight-common-c: the network link. https://github.com/lsalzman/enet  [licences/enet.txt]
nanors (MIT): Inside moonlight-common-c: repairing lost video. https://github.com/sleepybishop/nanors  [licences/nanors.txt]

PS5
---
chiaki-ng (AGPL-3.0): PS5 Remote Play, with MoonCast's changes (MoonCastDev/chiaki-ng-mooncast). https://github.com/streetpea/chiaki-ng  [licences/agpl-3.0.txt]
OpenSSL (OpenSSL): Inside chiaki-ng: encryption. https://www.openssl.org  [licences/openssl.txt]
curl (curl): Inside chiaki-ng: PSN sign-in and play away from home. https://curl.se  [licences/curl.txt]
json-c (MIT): Inside chiaki-ng: PSN messages. https://github.com/json-c/json-c  [licences/json-c.txt]
miniupnpc (BSD-3-Clause): Inside chiaki-ng: router port setup (UPnP). https://github.com/miniupnp/miniupnp  [licences/miniupnpc.txt]
Jerasure (BSD-3-Clause): Inside chiaki-ng: repairing lost video. https://github.com/streetpea/jerasure  [licences/jerasure.txt]
GF-Complete (BSD-3-Clause): Inside chiaki-ng: the maths behind the repair. https://github.com/streetpea/gf-complete  [licences/gf-complete.txt]
nanopb (Zlib): Inside chiaki-ng: messages with the console. https://github.com/nanopb/nanopb  [licences/nanopb.txt]
Oboe (Apache-2.0): Inside chiaki-ng: sound. https://github.com/google/oboe  [licences/apache-2.0.txt]
LLVM libc++ (Apache-2.0 with LLVM exception): The C++ runtime chiaki-ng runs on. https://libcxx.llvm.org  [licences/libcxx.txt]

